  "description": "DIGQIV crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n n a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H50 Gd4 N44 O5,2(C2 H3 N1),21(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 3 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 3 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 3 O neighbors; Gd2B (Gd) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.671-5.216 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.43-177.77°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [(L3-2H)2(L3-H)2Gd4(O)(N3)4](CH3CN)2(H2O)21. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 21 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
